{"version":1,"content":"<p>印尼山火持續，更引發嚴重空氣污染危機。</p><p>重災區Palangkaraya的天空被厚重濃煙染成末日般的黃橙色，能見度跌至僅剩數十米。</p><p>煙霾更跨境肆虐，迫使鄰國東帝汶宣布停課三天。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:21:04.868817+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:51:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:54.388401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:54.388401+00:00","content_hash":"eef93c294aafc501652c80132cf6e65bb07580b55c77db96875865b1a48f2163","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}